WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.077 --> 00:00:01.014
(upbeat music)

00:00:01.014 --> 00:00:01.944
- All right!

00:00:01.944 --> 00:00:02.777
Yes, band!

00:00:03.821 --> 00:00:06.061
Give it up for y'all!
(audience cheering)

00:00:06.061 --> 00:00:06.957
Welcome back, y'all,

00:00:06.957 --> 00:00:08.190
We are almost out of time,

00:00:08.190 --> 00:00:09.930
but let's share one more positive story

00:00:09.930 --> 00:00:11.100
from the world of social media.

00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:12.229
This is What I'm Liking.

00:00:12.229 --> 00:00:14.850
(upbeat music)

00:00:14.850 --> 00:00:17.550
A mother in Minnesota is
spreading joy online, all

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:19.530
while fighting the
toughest fight of her life.

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.200
This is Stephanie who is
battling breast cancer.

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:25.620
Despite her diagnosis, she is
not letting it get her down.

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:27.450
So Stephanie creates dance videos

00:00:27.450 --> 00:00:29.670
at each of her chemo appointments.

00:00:29.670 --> 00:00:30.930
Not only is it helping her,

00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:33.270
but it's inspiring thousands
online, which is incredible.

00:00:33.270 --> 00:00:34.860
Her story was even featured

00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:37.200
on her local afternoon
show, Twin Cities Live

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:39.630
on KSTP-TV in the Twin Cities.

00:00:39.630 --> 00:00:40.830
Let's get her in here, everybody.

00:00:40.830 --> 00:00:41.697
What's up, Stephanie?

00:00:41.697 --> 00:00:42.690
(audience cheering)

00:00:42.690 --> 00:00:44.403
So what inspired you to do this?

00:00:45.240 --> 00:00:47.280
- Well, during chemo it takes about four

00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:51.870
to five hours per session,
and I got really bored.

00:00:51.870 --> 00:00:55.140
So I would scroll through
TikTok and find these dances

00:00:55.140 --> 00:00:57.750
and think to myself, "I can do that."

00:00:57.750 --> 00:01:01.500
So I just started doing
these TikTok dances

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:03.540
to pass the time.

00:01:03.540 --> 00:01:05.730
But then it became bigger than me

00:01:05.730 --> 00:01:10.710
and, it became something that
I just had to continue to do.

00:01:10.710 --> 00:01:12.150
- Oh, my God, you're so good.

00:01:12.150 --> 00:01:14.670
So where are you in your
treatment right now?

00:01:14.670 --> 00:01:16.461
You're so good at dancing, oh, my gosh.

00:01:16.461 --> 00:01:17.475
(Stephanie chuckling)

00:01:17.475 --> 00:01:21.210
- Right now, I'm still
continuing my chemotherapy.

00:01:21.210 --> 00:01:26.210
I've got about 53 chemos
under my belt since 2020.

00:01:26.370 --> 00:01:27.990
My scans are looking good,

00:01:27.990 --> 00:01:29.880
so we're just gonna continue the fight

00:01:29.880 --> 00:01:33.270
until they tell me I
don't need to anymore.

00:01:33.270 --> 00:01:34.920
- Amen.
(audience applauding)

00:01:34.920 --> 00:01:37.410
Well, we are truly hoping for
the best for you, Stephanie.

00:01:37.410 --> 00:01:40.397
All right, I'm liking your
posts right now, keep dancing.

00:01:40.397 --> 00:01:41.230
(audience cheering)

00:01:41.230 --> 00:01:43.140
- [Stephanie] Thank you, absolutely.

00:01:43.140 --> 00:01:44.850
- And that's not all,
our season-long partner,

00:01:44.850 --> 00:01:47.100
Pilot Pen, makers of G2, the go-to pen

00:01:47.100 --> 00:01:48.600
on the Kelly Clarkson Show, wants

00:01:48.600 --> 00:01:51.330
to honor truly unstoppable
people like yourself, ma'am.

00:01:51.330 --> 00:01:53.670
So they're gonna write
you check for $1,000.

00:01:53.670 --> 00:01:56.459
How's that sound?
(audience cheering)

00:01:56.459 --> 00:01:58.176
- Wow.
- Yeah.

00:01:58.176 --> 00:01:59.243
- [Stephanie] Thank you.

00:01:59.243 --> 00:02:01.230
- You're welcome.

00:02:01.230 --> 00:02:03.701
Aww, I wish I could hug you right now.

00:02:03.701 --> 00:02:05.397
(audience cheering)

00:02:05.397 --> 00:02:07.680
Stephanie, God bless you, girl!

00:02:07.680 --> 00:02:08.850
All right, thank you so much.

00:02:08.850 --> 00:02:09.683
And thank you

00:02:09.683 --> 00:02:11.313
to all our guests, Michelle Rodriguez.

00:02:12.415 --> 00:02:14.773
(audience cheering)
(Kelly faintly speaking)

00:02:14.773 --> 00:02:16.267
Y'all have a great day and if
it's not, try and change it.

